HST Office: neutral ribbon frame for direction A, through existing configuration.

Use the native dialog colour at full opacity instead of blending the module
colour. Do not force global UI colours, fonts or dark document colours.
Existing profiles overriding this property retain their value. No paint change.
License: upstream file remains MPL-2.0.
---
--- a/officecfg/registry/schema/org/openoffice/Office/Common.xcs
+++ b/officecfg/registry/schema/org/openoffice/Office/Common.xcs
@@ -5260,7 +5260,7 @@
           <desc>Specifies which transparency at which module and dialog color are merged for
           the notebookbar. Use 0 for full module and 255 for full dialog.</desc>
         </info>
-        <value>150</value>
+        <value>255</value>
       </prop>
       <prop oor:name="SymbolStyle" oor:type="xs:string" oor:nillable="false">
